<dt>Provenance equations</dt><dd>ι_P: 𝔰𝔲(2)_L ⊕ 𝔲(1)_Y → 𝔠_W(P), ε_a ↦ −(i/2)σ_a, ε_B ↦ −(i/2)I_P, α_P = ι_P⁻¹.  W^± = (w¹ ∓ i w²)/√2, (Z, A) = R_W(w³, b).  Q = T₃ + Y = diag(1, 0).  Depends on W-0 v0.2 and on 05a SD.0, SD.9–SD.10 via F5-L1-1 v0.1.</dd>
<dt>Root closure at the seam</dt><dd>K = Stab(η̂, Ĉ) ⊂ GL(8, ℝ), 𝔨 ≅ 𝔰𝔬(1,1) ⊕ 𝔲(3), dim 10; carrier 𝔠_W(P) = 𝔲(P) ⊕ 0_{P^⊥} ⊂ 𝔲(3) ⊂ 𝔨. It commutes with the 𝔰𝔬(1,1) generator; the Lorentzian G office is not mapped. Plane P is a supplied choice and its selection is OPEN.</dd>
<dt>Source artifact</dt><dd><a href="downloads/W1_v0_2_packet.zip">downloads/W1_v0_2_packet.zip</a></dd>
<dt>Artifact SHA-256</dt><dd><code class="h">22b92b32d93b2a7d7446a7f147475e7dac98c9f84880f96b1ac297618037b50f</code></dd>
<dt>Run</dt><dd><code>python3 -I verify_w1_carrier_adapter_v0_2.py</code></dd>
